@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### 0. Logowanie (Jan Kowalski) - token do kolejnych requestów
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jan.kowalski@example.com",
  "password": "bardzo-dlugie-haslo"
}

### 1. Brak nagłówka Authorization -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations

### 2. Zły format nagłówka: Basic -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Authorization: Basic amFuOmhhc2xv

### 3. Zły format nagłówka: Bearer bez tokenu -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer

### 4. Token ze złym podpisem -> 401 (wklej token i zmień jeden znak w ostatniej części)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer WKLEJ_TOKEN_ZE_ZMIENIONYM_ZNAKIEM

### 5. Token ze zmienionym payloadem (role: ADMIN), oryginalny podpis -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer WKLEJ_ZMODYFIKOWANY_TOKEN

### 6. Token wygasły (JWT_EXPIRES_IN=10s, odczekaj 10 s po logowaniu) -> 401 Token expired
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 7. Poprawny token -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 8. Nowa rezerwacja - userId z tokenu -> 201, w odpowiedzi user: { id, email }
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 2,
  "participants": 4,
  "startTime": "2026-12-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-12-01T11:00:00Z"
}

### 9. Próba podania userId w body -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 2,
  "userId": 1,
  "participants": 4,
  "startTime": "2026-12-02T10:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-12-02T11:00:00Z"
}

### 10. Próba podania reservedBy w body -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 2,
  "reservedBy": "Ktoś Inny",
  "participants": 4,
  "startTime": "2026-12-03T10:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-12-03T11:00:00Z"
}
